    "label": "9",
    "prompt": "In how many arrangements of the letters in TATTOO are the two Os separated?",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$40$",
      "worked": "TATTOO has three identical Ts and two identical Os.\n\nTotal arrangements:\n$$\\frac{6!}{3!\\times2!}=60$$\nTreat OO as one unit. Arrangements with the Os together:\n$$\\frac{5!}{3!}=20$$\nArrangements with the Os separated:\n$$60-20=40$$",
